# Real Vector Database

A real vector database stores embeddings permanently and searches them efficiently.

Our current project uses:

```text
MemoryVectorStore
```

This is good for learning.

But it is not enough for production because the index disappears when the server restarts.

## What A Vector Database Stores

It stores:

```text
embedding vector
chunk text
document ID
metadata
page number
user or organization ID
```

Example:

```js
{
  id: "chunk_001",
  vector: [0.12, -0.04, 0.88],
  text: "CX-MA-001 - Amina Morrison...",
  metadata: {
    documentId: "doc_001",
    page: 6,
    branch: "Morocco"
  }
}
```

