## Simple Flow

Indexing:

```text
PDF
  -> chunks
  -> embeddings
  -> save vectors in vector database
```

Question:

```text
user question
  -> question embedding
  -> vector database search
  -> relevant chunks
  -> LLM answer
```

## Metadata Filtering

A real vector database can filter by metadata.

Example:

```text
Search only Morocco branch documents.
Search only documents owned by user_001.
Search only HR policies.
```

Example filter:

```js
{
  branch: "Morocco",
  accessLevel: "employee"
}
```

## Why It Matters

A real vector database gives us:

```text
Persistent embeddings
Faster search for large datasets
Document filters
Multi-user support
Better production scaling
```

